          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("You’ve captured a village, which now flies the red-and-white colors of our banner. Each village we own provides us with some income — and importantly for you, provides a place to rest and recover."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<span color=' <<'> + _Starting your turn in a village will <b><i>heal you for 8 hitpoints</i></b>. End your turn now.</span>"),
