              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Hooray! The dummy is destroyed, and I’ve gained valuable combat experience!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("<span color=' <<'> + _Units gain a small amount of experience when attacking or defending, but gain much more by striking a finishing blow, especially against high-level enemies. With enough experience, a soldier will advance to a powerful level 2 unit.</span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Not bad, you’ve smashed it to splinters. ...is it too late to mention that I was supposed to return that after we finished training? Maybe I can find a replacement once we reach Westin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Mari",
            text: _("Of course before we can reach Westin, we’ll first have to fight our way past these bandits."),
          },
